WEBVTT

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.540
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.540
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.750
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.750
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:35.010
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:35.010
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:39.010
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:39.010
I always long for you...

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:49.440
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:49.440
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:58.490
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:58.490
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.620
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.620
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:07.120
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:07.120
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.130
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.130
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.170
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.170
Hear my reality!

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.090
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:18.090
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.640
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.640
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.600
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.600
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.020
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:29.020
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.110
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.110
Let's say you are the light

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.570
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.570
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.610
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.610
The tear-colored diamond

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:44.410
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:44.410
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:49.960
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:49.960
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.130
Deaiwo...

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.130
Nor of meeting people...

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.650
Okay, I'm good.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.620
Servant

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.620
Still no sign of Kuze-san?

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:24.580
No. She's been absent from school since that day.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:25.910
I see.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:27.830
And Haruna, as well.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:32.880
Looks like her body can't handle
the shock of her memories coming back.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.090
Oh no.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:41.760
But was it really all right with you?

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.810
Haruna said she'd explain the situation to Kanade-san herself.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.730
I can't stop her.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.730
Even if it would destroy my relationship with Kanade-san.

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:00.320
I heard everything from Hina-chan.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:07.410
Kanade-san. Um...

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:09.580
Wait-

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.050
Kanade-san?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:19.300
Thank you for saving Hina-chan.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:26.640
You saved Hina-chan when she nearly got in an accident.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.640
Thank you so much.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.850
She insisted on saying thank you.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:37.230
I see.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.150
Kanade-san.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.530
You know, now, that I'm not human...

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.580
But you're still Eririn!

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:51.330
You're Shuchikan Academy's amazing Student Council Vice President...

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.330
...and my precious friend!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:12.890
I'm so glad. I was about to lose an important bond.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.100
Kuze-san.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.320
Good morning, Kirikiri!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.160
Kuze-san, good morning.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.550
What are Dependents?

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.680
Good morning, Miss Black Cape.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.180
Are you in search of your Master?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.610
"Freeze Dry" indeed.

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.360
So you think she is a Dependent?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.570
And her Master would be...

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:08.120
She's got horrible taste as always.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.670
If Kuze-san is a Dependent, then her Master would be...

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.540
Is it her?

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:22.170
Do you know anything, Nii-san?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:25.880
I don't know. Do you want to ask her?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:29.890
Could that beautiful Kuze be your Dependent?

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:33.140
Oh, can you tell? In fact she is.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.140
Yes, I knew it.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:45.900
Yeah, like that kind of conversation will ever happen with her.

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:49.530
Besides, you wouldn't want to meet her, would you?

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:52.540
Especially if it's regarding Dependents.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.250
No!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.580
It's not like that...

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.750
Erika-senpai.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.380
Shiro. It's not something you need to hear.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.550
But I'm part of Togi family.

00:06:11.550 --> 00:06:12.510
This concerns me-

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.680
It seems the tea has become cold.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.690
Yes, I'll remake it.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.780
Anyway, you should stay out of this from here on.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.610
But!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.700
It's not like you've forgotten...

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.610
...that promise, have you?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:35.950
I'm sorry!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:42.080
I'm late. Tsukasa kept bugging me to show him my homework.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.550
So how much have you discussed without me?

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.510
Eh? Did something happen?

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.020
No, just the usual fighting between us. Don't worry about it.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.850
You're late, Hasekura-kun.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.810
Because of you, I've wasted precious time.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:06.190
As punishment, you're to clean all the bathrooms on campus by yourself.

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.070
But that's too harsh, so...

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.660
Oh, I know.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.370
I'll make you the lead organizer of the Culture Festival.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.830
And you, too, Erika.

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:19.750
I'll be counting on you two.

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.420
Here's your reference material.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
Lead organizers of the Culture Festival?

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
September Schedule

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
Accident Prevention Training     Sep. 1

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
Culture Festival     Sep. 10 & 11

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
Beautification Week     Sep. 12 to Sep. 19

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.720
Help for the "Consideration Meetings"

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:35.100
Right. Our school's Cultural Festival is right after summer vacation.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.770
So you have to start preparations now.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.850
Otherwise you won't make it in time, eh?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.520
But why were Kouhei-kun and Sendo-san chosen?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:49.440
Irori-san and Nii-sama are sixth years and will be leaving the Student Council soon.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.950
So they're trying to get their successors ready.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:53.990
Great thinking, Iorin!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.200
It's pretty hard on us, though.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:01.660
Putting together a proposal
and coming up with ideas for events.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.250
It looks like a full load.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.500
Don't worry! We'll help out, so feel free to ask us for anything.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.000
Right, Heiji?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.220
Me, too?

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.340
I suppose.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.430
You're a sixth year, too, Onee-chan.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:16.890
So what?

00:08:16.890 --> 00:08:20.980
The Culture Festival. <i>The  major event at Shuchikan Academy.</i>

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.600
We've got to make it really fun!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.270
Yeah!

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:26.900
Thank you, everyone.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:29.020
So how can we help?

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.650
We know we need lots of food stands.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.860
Yes!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.860
Maid café!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:34.490
Clichéd.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.700
Say what?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:36.620
How's this?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.370
Too bland.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.540
How so?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.540
Don't get so worked up.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:44.500
Shiro-chan! You want to do a maid café, right?

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.920
How does this go?

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.790
Oh, this?

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.920
I think the details were written somewhere here.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.300
See you, Kouhei.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.800
Good night.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.270
Don't hold it in too much.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:09.110
I think being overly considerate is not the same as being kind.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:10.980
Bye.

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.860
See ya tomorrow.

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.910
Yeah, see you.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:37.630
I have someone I'd like you to meet.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.170
Even if it is the President's order, why do we have to go shopping for supplies?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.630
It's one of our precious Sundays, too.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.670
You're going shopping?

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:19.550
Go buy some snacks for the tea party.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.890
Thanks for your continued patronage.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:25.770
Thank you, too.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:33.110
Um, this is still some time away, but after summer break, the Culture Festival will be held at our school.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:35.360
Could you support us?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.400
Culture Festival? That's great!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.910
The Sports Festival was fun, too.

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.990
Ask us for anything.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.290
We'll be glad to help out.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.410
Good luck. We'll hope for your success.

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.960
Everyone's got high hopes for the Culture Festival.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:58.380
Yeah. It'll be the last one for Nii-san and Kanade-san,

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.090
so we have to do our best.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:07.390
You won't drink to that?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.240
You know, there's something I want you to tell me!

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.450
Wh-What?

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.420
What are Dependents?

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.420
They're...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:41.130
Sorry if I'm wrong.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:47.180
Ever since we saw Kuze-san that night,
you seem to be distracted by something.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:51.850
Share it with me.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.560
Don't bear it alone.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.360
Hasekura-kun...

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:02.150
You're right. I was thinking I had to tell you at some point.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:32.430
Dependents are those who have formed a contract with a vampire.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:34.390
A contract?

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:39.820
You mean how those who have their blood sucked by vampires also become vampires?

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.820
That's only in books and movies.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.450
We're different.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:52.620
Dependents are born from drinking a vampire's blood.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.170
Drinking a vampire's blood...

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:02.670
Like vampires, they do not age, nor do they die...

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:06.300
...and they have astounding physical abilities.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:17.770
Though at times, they go into long sleeps against their will, as though their batteries had run out.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.860
Other than that, they're no different from any human.

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.740
More importantly...

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:35.210
...when a Master-Dependent relationship is formed through a contract...

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:41.340
...the Master's orders to the Dependent become absolute.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.210
And...

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:50.760
...Kuze-san's Master is likely to be her.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.470
"Her"?

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.220
Yes.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.640
My brother's and my...

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.560
...mother.

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:32.300
Stay.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.140
What a violent woman.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:40.770
You, too. You're becoming crazier with every meeting, Kaya.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:44.980
This round of tag took you longer than others.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.490
But it was quite entertaining to watch you.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:52.780
Yes, but this is the end of this game.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.200
Freeze.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.880
Come close.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.380
Show me your face.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:24.020
You haven't changed at all, Kiriha.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:28.150
No matter how many years pass, you're still as beautiful as ever.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:42.870
Live the eternity with the vampire,
swear loyalty to your Master, console her heart,

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.790
and at times, donate your blood.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.510
That's what Dependents exist for.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.930
And yet she refuses to do any of this.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.090
What a worthless daughter she is.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:16:03.020
As a condition for entering Shuchikan Academy, I made a promise with my mother.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:04.020
A promise?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.990
By the time I graduate, I must make a Dependent.

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:19.540
If I don't, I will be forced to go back to the house and live there forever.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.620
Just like when I was a child.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:31.670
She's always hated me for not behaving like a proper vampire.

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:38.010
What?!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:43.190
But I still have time before graduation.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:47.360
I may find a way out without having to take a Dependent.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.230
So don't worry about it.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.160
Then...

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.410
If it comes down to it...

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.580
...would I be suitable?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.370
Hasekura-kun?

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.380
If you're fine with it...

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.380
I'll become your Dependent.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:20.260
Don't say such a ridiculous thing!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:21.640
Don't you understand?!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.560
Becoming a Dependent means you'll no longer be human!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.980
Yeah, but-

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:27.940
I don't want that!

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:35.360
Making a Dependents means... taking away their lives as humans and forcing them to obey you...

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.240
...sucking their blood as you please...

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.080
I don't want to live like that.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.450
But at this rate, you're going to be locked up in your house, right?!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.290
I can't-

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:46.160
I want to live as a human!

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.670
It scares me.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:02.180
If I take a Dependent, I'm afraid I'll no longer be me.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.100
I'm scared.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.940
I will never drink blood from a human.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.650
I will not take a Dependent either.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:20.450
Even if that is un-vampiric.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.830
Because I...

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.970
I'm sure Kanade-san's tired of waiting.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:46.890
Let's hurry!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:54.610
...because I don't ever want to lose them again...

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.780
My precious bonds.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.290
Oh.

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:17.010
How rare to see you here, Sendo-kun.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:23.600
How mean. I have times when I want to be alone to think.

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.350
I apologize.

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:29.890
But it's dangerous these days, so you should return to the dorm before it gets dark.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.520
I don't have to worry about that.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.610
The vampire case is over.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.150
So don't worry, Shizuko-chan.

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.530
You need to stop calling me that, Sendo-kun.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.750
I-In any case, you need to return.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.000
Did you know?

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.920
What vampires desire most is
the blood of the person they love.

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.840
Joking.

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:04.840
Good night.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.980
The person they love, huh?

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:20.110
I'll take care of the things we bought.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.200
Okay. Thank you.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.030
Bye. See you tomorrow.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:28.950
Hey.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.080
Um... To be honest, that made me happy.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:40.510
How you said if I didn't mind, you would...

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:47.180
Never mind!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.300
Let's do our best!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:55.230
Let's make the Culture Festival a success.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.770
After all, it's the main event of school life.

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.360
Yup.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.170
So... I'll see you tomorrow.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.670
See you tomorrow.

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:23.380
Tomorrow...

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.400
Why?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.040
I want blood...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:54.160
I want Hasekura-kun's...

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.210
What am I saying?

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.590
Hasekura-kun...

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:06.050
I...

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:24.480
I miss you

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:44.630
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:44.630
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:49.380
Sou ima ha...

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:49.380
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:53.680 --> 00:23:03.440
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:53.680 --> 00:23:03.440
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:09.150
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:09.150
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.290
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.290
You're only at a loss.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:18.290
I miss you

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:22.540
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:22.540
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.460
I miss you

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:28.800
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:28.800
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.680
I miss you

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:34.430
Negatteru kara

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:34.430
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.440
I miss you...

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:21.060
Tenth Episode

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:21.060
「Thirst」

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:09.510
Discursive summer.

00:24:09.510 --> 00:24:11.670
Noisy cicadas.

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.970
White clouds are aloft again...

00:24:16.470 --> 00:24:19.680
...floating in the windless sky.
